            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A communication system is described which comprises a communication terminal device, a base station device performing radio communication with the communication terminal device, and a base station controller controlling the base station device, wherein the communication terminal device is a machine type communication (MTC) device, the base station controller includes a mobility management entity (MME), and data is transmitted to the MME from the communication terminal device via the base station device.</p>
            </abstract>
